WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
These don't happen
exclusively during REM sleep.

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:08.300
They can intrude during any stage,
breaking through whenever your guard is

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:13.180
down. What makes level 7 different
from every other level is

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.510
that you can't dismiss
it when you wake up.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.070
You can't tell yourself it was
just a dream because it wasn't.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:25.390
It happened. The nightmare is just
your mind refusing to let you forget.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.260
Your body remembers too.

